  "labels": [
    "Odometry is ORACLE-ASSISTED (true increments plus noise, gyro bias std 0.002 rad/s, as dream/sim/g1_mobile.py).",
    "The semantic detector is ORACLE-ASSISTED: rendered segmentation plus an ASSUMED, uncalibrated noise model (dream/sim/semantic_sensor.py); NOMINAL except H3 (DEGRADED).",
    "H1-H3 use the KINEMATIC SURROGATE base (dream/sim/kinematic_base.py: no legged dynamics, no falls); H4 uses the pretrained whole-body controller in MuJoCo.",
    "Room-type knowledge: ConceptNet 5.7 extract (third_party/household_knowledge), heuristic associations, not calibrated probabilities.",
    "Remembered sightings (scenario I) are placed in the odometry frame with the true start pose (oracle-assisted initial localisation).",
    "Requests are read by the explicit grammar (dream/tools/intent.py); no language model runs in these episodes."
